  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical support land tenure</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tekniskt st&#xF6;d till markfr&#xE5;gor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har gett support till ett stort antal landrelaterade insatser antingen som project eller komponenter i st&#xF6;rre program. Sida arbetar ocks&#xE5; med landr&#xE4;ttigheter p&#xE5; global policyniv&#xE5;. Detta uppdrag inneh&#xE5;ller tekniskt st&#xF6;d till Sida i samband med f&#xF6;reberedelser och f&#xF6;rahandlingar av frivilliga riktlinjer f&#xF6;r ansvarsfull hantering av jordbruk, skogsbruk samt st&#xF6;d i samband med arbete i EU arb grupp</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has over the years provided support to a large number of land-related inverventions either as stand alone projects or a componens in larger programmes. Sida also works with land tenure on a global policy leve. This project contaings technical support to Sida in preparation of the Volontary guidelines on REsponsible Gov on land tenure as well as technical assistance with the EU working group</narrative>
  </description>
